# onMounted, onUpdated, onUnmounted, etc.

In Composition API, lifecycle hooks are imported as functions and called inside `setup()`.

```javascript
import { onMounted, onUnmounted, onUpdated } from 'vue'

setup() {
  onMounted(() => {
    console.log('Component mounted')
  })

  onUnmounted(() => {
    console.log('Component unmounted')
  })
}
```

These functions can be called multiple times and the callbacks will run in the order they are registered.
